                f'<td class="user-management-last-login">{esc(display_datetime(u["last_login_at"]) or "从未")}</td><td><div class="row-actions user-management-actions">'
                f'<a class="secondary button-link user-management-action-detail" href="/users/{u["id"]}">修改信息</a>'
                f'<a class="secondary button-link user-management-action-detail" href="/users/{u["id"]}?tab=permissions">权限</a>'
                f'<form method="post" action="/users/{u["id"]}/toggle"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{esc(self.csrf)}"><button class="ghost user-management-action-toggle" {disabled}>{"禁用" if u["is_active"] else "启用"}</button></form>'
                f'<button class="secondary user-management-action-reset" type="button" data-dialog-open="reset-{u["id"]}">重置密码</button>'
                f'<button class="danger user-management-action-delete" type="button" data-dialog-open="delete-user-{u["id"]}" {disabled}>删除</button>'
                f'</div>'
                f'<dialog id="reset-{u["id"]}"><form method="post" action="/users/{u["id"]}/reset-password"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{esc(self.csrf)}"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>重置 {esc(u["display_name"])} 的密码</h2><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-dialog-close>×</button></div><label>新密码<input type="password" name="new_password" minlength="10" required></label><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost" data-dialog-close>取消</button><button class="primary">确认重置</button></div></form></dialog>'
                f'<dialog id="delete-user-{u["id"]}"><form method="post" action="/users/{u["id"]}/delete"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{esc(self.csrf)}"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>删除用户</h2><button type="button" class="icon-button" data-dialog-close>×</button></div><p>删除后该用户不能再登录，历史操作日志会保留。</p><p><strong>{esc(u["display_name"])}</strong> · {esc(u["username"])}</p><label>确认删除请输入 DELETE<input name="delete_confirm" autocomplete="off" required></label><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost" data-dialog-close>取消</button><button class="danger">确认删除</button></div></form></dialog>'
                f'</td></tr>'
